      <data key="d2">Tabiturient provides data on university admissions, including entrance exam scores and pass rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabiturient provides data about entrance exams and minimum entry scores for various programs.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabiturient provides data about admission requirements and pass marks for various programs.&lt;SEP&gt;Source of data about passing scores.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabiturient provides data on entry scores for various programs.</data>
