    <node id="Physics">
      <data key="d0">Physics</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Physics is one of the optional subjects for entrance exams in Geology and Geophysics programs.&lt;SEP&gt;Physics is an optional exam for Mechanico-Mathematical Faculty admissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Physics is another optional subject for university entrance exams alongside Russian language, mathematics, and ICT.&lt;SEP&gt;An optional entrance exam subject that can be chosen instead of Computer Science.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-688c0fd847257d42c90181b4478949e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681b87b5ddf40fbbc0a67227a216a8c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a035eeb7895b7dadfd008f91646edee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b465d7cca52d8827f04039160075b090</data>
