    <node id="Novosibirsk State University">
      <data key="d0">Novosibirsk State University</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e2ced4912d75885cf341fcdfd11a122e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c2048cbd8ab15bf77f8ce857685327f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b36f387ee21bd85d1d5642ee853719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3d6a8b784f4b3587c2e289eeda2d55e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40c4dad280d9f13d93d64edb2d86f788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5402055951e8d54d469a3cebbfc97a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa94440482207198e1a94b6746f1803e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d58c6ab3a7182fec5879e381a537083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0c0788d56bf6ead94f10669696b1b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7834c0568e49191de930f90be1807b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d74b50c933d24d32754ba9493cd5e8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b5212b42d4fdb329d220e300038f8eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d3f7098ee5d3b86e0310de336d4916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-529d82ff29451a356cdb38d5fb98bd33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae165f18dcbab047fc85ffcc2874701</data>
      <data key="d2">Novosibirsk State University (NSU), also known as НГУ, is a large Russian research university located in Akademgorodok, Novosibirsk. It holds the statuses of a national research university and a federal autonomous university, with a core focus on the integration of education and science and the early involvement of students in research activities.

The university comprises multiple faculties, including the Faculty of Natural Sciences, the Physical Faculty, and the Geological and Geophysical Faculty. It publishes its own admission requirements and organizes a wide array of academic and extracurricular events, such as the "Scientific Picnic." NSU supports student initiatives and hosts various clubs and circles, including those for foreign students.

In terms of student support and infrastructure, Novosibirsk State University offers the NSU+ scholarship and provides various infrastructure services. It is also the parent institution for affiliated entities such as Future Professional NSU.&lt;SEP&gt;Novosibirsk State University (NSU) is a university that provides student dormitories for its students.&lt;SEP&gt;Novosibirsk State University (NSU) is a university that provides dormitory accommodations for its students, particularly first-year and non-resident students.&lt;SEP&gt;Novosibirsk State University (NSU) is the university that houses the Faculty of Information Technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Novosibirsk State University is a university associated with the Faculty Of Information Technology and the Sigma Summer Scientific And Olympiad School.&lt;SEP&gt;Novosibirsk State University (NSU) is the institution that houses the Faculty of Economics.&lt;SEP&gt;The university of which the Institute of Medicine and Psychology is a structural subdivision.</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772781218</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
