      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Akademgorodok is the location where Mechanico-Mathematical Faculty operates and maintains connections with scientific-research institutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Akademgorodok is the location where the university dormitories are situated, approximately a 10-minute walk from the university buildings.&lt;SEP&gt;Akademgorodok is a location associated with Novosibirsk State University.&lt;SEP&gt;Akademgorodok is the specific district in Novosibirsk where the educational institution is located.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-681b87b5ddf40fbbc0a67227a216a8c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7834c0568e49191de930f90be1807b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d3f7098ee5d3b86e0310de336d4916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-027a28f4cdd37c9fe76191601a9a6185</data>
