    <node id="Mathematics">
      <data key="d0">Mathematics</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Mathematics is a primary focus area for Mechanico-Mathematical Faculty, offering undergraduate programs in various profiles.&lt;SEP&gt;A required subject for entry into the Economic Faculty NSU, assessed through the Mathematics exam.&lt;SEP&gt;Required subject for entrance exams, typically included in technical programs.&lt;SEP&gt;Mathematics is a field of study focusing on fundamental areas like geometry, topology, number theory, risk analysis, and statistics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-681b87b5ddf40fbbc0a67227a216a8c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb0ebf4eb1e54439f1b32cb8c8f17714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00319a41a425f6d6ec4233df0775ae96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddcef96986201d45e53c49db3bb62169</data>
