    <node id="Bachelor's Degree Program">
      <data key="d0">Bachelor's Degree Program</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A four-year undergraduate degree program offered by the faculty.&lt;SEP&gt;Bachelor's degree programs offered cover general physics, applied physics, optics, and high-energy physics.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bachelor's degree program at FIT is in the field of Informatics and Computer Engineering, featuring deep fundamental training combined with practical software development skills.&lt;SEP&gt;A six-year undergraduate program in General Medicine at the Institute.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96824a0b7bedfff01e1e931021742836&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b36f387ee21bd85d1d5642ee853719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b5212b42d4fdb329d220e300038f8eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4951a804582e8ead40e48ff068044f3</data>
