    <node id="Bachelor's Degree">
      <data key="d0">Bachelor's Degree</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Bachelor's degree typically takes four years to complete.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bachelor's Degree is the first level of the multi-level training system implemented by the Faculty of Information Technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Bachelor's Degree is an educational program for which admission is based on Unified State Exam results.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e2976471c53db5fbb9c437e851fe7def&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b5212b42d4fdb329d220e300038f8eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d3f7098ee5d3b86e0310de336d4916</data>
