      <data key="d2">The Siberian Branch of the Russian Academy of Sciences (SO RAN) is a scientific organization with which the faculty is closely integrated.&lt;SEP&gt;The Siberian Branch of the Russian Academy of Sciences (SO RAN) is a research institution where 3rd and 4th year students undertake internships.&lt;SEP&gt;The Siberian Branch of the Russian Academy of Sciences is a scientific research institute that actively collaborates with the Faculty of Information Technology.&lt;SEP&gt;The Siberian Branch of the Russian Academy of Sciences (CO PAH) is integrated with the institute, providing access to world-class laboratories and real scientific projects.</data>
