    <node id="Unified State Exam">
      <data key="d0">Unified State Exam</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A standardized national exam in Russia; high scores can qualify students for special scholarships.&lt;SEP&gt;The national exam in Russia, the results of which are used for university admission.&lt;SEP&gt;Unified State Exam is an exam used for admission to bachelor's programs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Unified State Exam (EGE) is the entrance examination for the Economics bachelor's program, requiring scores in Mathematics (profile), Russian language, and a choice of Social Studies/History/Computer Science/Foreign Language/Geography.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8ad1721f8f1afc66aa5902ac20f6fe1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bff5f872bf8300f62d80f59e3ab58270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d3f7098ee5d3b86e0310de336d4916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-529d82ff29451a356cdb38d5fb98bd33</data>
